{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish the greatest regime in history in this darkly satirical political sim + FPS roguelite hybrid. Build a prosperous totalitarian state, enforce policies, and lead your troops to victory in first-person battles. Dictate wisely as your choices will shape society, for better or worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/39e04451baf2766923372d0bfbc25fe8.avif?t=1757646463\" width=1560 height=304 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/073077c648457d490a3fd1517c78da55.poster.avif?t=1757646463\" width=780 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/073077c648457d490a3fd1517c78da55.webm?t=1757646463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/073077c648457d490a3fd1517c78da55.mp4?t=1757646463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mold your populace</strong> by enacting tyrannical or benevolent reforms to sway citizens' Fear, Happiness, Hunger, and Loyalty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 Institute curfews, rationing, indoctrination centers, or public feasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 Watch as policies spark gratitude\u2026 or rebellion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 Crush uprisings with propaganda, surveillance towers, mass rallies, or brutal force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/011d72d637db27cfdfc140d42fb9007f.avif?t=1757646463\" width=1560 height=304 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/1ef20d9b2f1f9d4977a0f941629b6511.poster.avif?t=1757646463\" width=780 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/1ef20d9b2f1f9d4977a0f941629b6511.webm?t=1757646463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/1ef20d9b2f1f9d4977a0f941629b6511.mp4?t=1757646463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your state apparatus.</strong> Construct factories, housing, armories, and surveillance networks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 Automate production lines and resource gathering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 Assign troops to mining, logistics, or police duties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 Dictate salaries, healthcare, housing density, and working conditions, all with real consequences for morale, productivity, and dissent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/eb939a1792e15fa36e88107f8c0e9c10.avif?t=1757646463\" width=1560 height=304 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/fb68b08012e40dea74d4f85adfb0f8c6.poster.avif?t=1757646463\" width=780 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/fb68b08012e40dea74d4f85adfb0f8c6.webm?t=1757646463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/fb68b08012e40dea74d4f85adfb0f8c6.mp4?t=1757646463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead roguelite FPS engagements\u00a0</strong>and galactic expeditions in one seamless loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 Assault enemy outposts, recover resources, and conscript new citizens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 Choose Core Fragments during each expedition to gain unique buffs and change how you and your battalion fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 Earn experience, level up and invest points into stats and professional skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 Survive at any cost, or face the loss of soldiers, wasted resources, and rebellion at home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/5a4337e73a2845d7a98ba5cbd546607c.avif?t=1757646463\" width=1560 height=304 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pax Autocratica is a political sim, colony sim, and FPS roguelite hybrid that combines base building, citizen management, and first-person tactical combat in a sci-fi dystopian world. It offers a dynamic, accessible, and approachable gameplay experience for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>THE STATE OBSERVES ALL</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Your decisions are recorded in the annals of history...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you rule with compassion, cruelty, or pragmatic brutality?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your legacy is the future of humanity.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1067360?t=1757646463","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/eaf9f9363d8efaee9b68d45c0dbc84e1fe8c53a7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757646463","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/e894f7259f86ca304607ee68b414721e69488c77/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757646463","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/e894f7259f86ca304607ee68b414721e69488c77/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757646463","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work"},"demos":[{"appid":1069590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish the greatest regime in history in this darkly satirical political sim + FPS roguelite hybrid. Build a prosperous totalitarian state, enforce policies, and lead your troops to victory in first-person battles. Dictate wisely as your choices will shape society, for better or worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/39e04451baf2766923372d0bfbc25fe8.avif?t=1757646463\" width=1560 height=304 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/073077c648457d490a3fd1517c78da55.poster.avif?t=1757646463\" width=780 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/073077c648457d490a3fd1517c78da55.webm?t=1757646463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/073077c648457d490a3fd1517c78da55.mp4?t=1757646463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mold your populace</strong> by enacting tyrannical or benevolent reforms to sway citizens' Fear, Happiness, Hunger, and Loyalty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 Institute curfews, rationing, indoctrination centers, or public feasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 Watch as policies spark gratitude\u2026 or rebellion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 Crush uprisings with propaganda, surveillance towers, mass rallies, or brutal force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/011d72d637db27cfdfc140d42fb9007f.avif?t=1757646463\" width=1560 height=304 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/1ef20d9b2f1f9d4977a0f941629b6511.poster.avif?t=1757646463\" width=780 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/1ef20d9b2f1f9d4977a0f941629b6511.webm?t=1757646463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/1ef20d9b2f1f9d4977a0f941629b6511.mp4?t=1757646463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your state apparatus.</strong> Construct factories, housing, armories, and surveillance networks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 Automate production lines and resource gathering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 Assign troops to mining, logistics, or police duties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 Dictate salaries, healthcare, housing density, and working conditions, all with real consequences for morale, productivity, and dissent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/eb939a1792e15fa36e88107f8c0e9c10.avif?t=1757646463\" width=1560 height=304 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/fb68b08012e40dea74d4f85adfb0f8c6.poster.avif?t=1757646463\" width=780 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/fb68b08012e40dea74d4f85adfb0f8c6.webm?t=1757646463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/fb68b08012e40dea74d4f85adfb0f8c6.mp4?t=1757646463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead roguelite FPS engagements\u00a0</strong>and galactic expeditions in one seamless loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 Assault enemy outposts, recover resources, and conscript new citizens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 Choose Core Fragments during each expedition to gain unique buffs and change how you and your battalion fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 Earn experience, level up and invest points into stats and professional skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 Survive at any cost, or face the loss of soldiers, wasted resources, and rebellion at home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/5a4337e73a2845d7a98ba5cbd546607c.avif?t=1757646463\" width=1560 height=304 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pax Autocratica is a political sim, colony sim, and FPS roguelite hybrid that combines base building, citizen management, and first-person tactical combat in a sci-fi dystopian world. It offers a dynamic, accessible, and approachable gameplay experience for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>THE STATE OBSERVES ALL</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Your decisions are recorded in the annals of history...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you rule with compassion, cruelty, or pragmatic brutality?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your legacy is the future of humanity.</p>","d